<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Algoma University Contract</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <%= stylesheet_link_tag 'application', media: 'all' %>
    <style>
        .doc-wrapper {
            min-height: 1122px;
            width: 793px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 48px;
            position: relative;
        }
        .header-image {
            width: 2.6108333333333333in;
            height: 0.5375in;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .footer-image {
            width: 7.377497812773403in;
            height: 0.24166557305336833in;
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 20px;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .algoma-footer {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
        }
        .confidential {
            color: #C00000;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }
        .content-block {
            font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
            font-size: 11pt;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        .signature-line {
            border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
            width: 200px;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="doc-wrapper">
        <!-- Header Image -->
        <img src="<%= asset_path('algoma-logo.png') %>" class="header-image" alt="Letterhead">

        <!-- Date -->
        <div class="text-end mb-4">January 21, 2025</div>

        <!-- Address Block -->
        <div class="content-block">
            <p>
                <strong>
                    <i><%= full_name %></i>,<br>
                    <i><%= title %></i> <i><%= position %></i><br>
                    School of Computer Science and Technology<br>
                    Algoma University
                </strong>
            </p>

            <!-- Confidential Notice -->
            <p class="confidential">PERSONAL AND CONFIDENTIAL</p>

            <!-- Salutation -->
            <p>
                Dear <i><%= short_name %></i>. <i><%= last_name %></i>,
            </p>

            <!-- Main Content -->
            <p>
                This letter is being written to inform you that, as per the language
                in Article 35:06 of the 2023-2026 FTCA, your stipend for teaching
                <i><%= course_code %></i> as an overload in the <i><%= team_name %></i> term will be as
                follows:
            </p>

            <!-- Payment Options -->
            <div class="ms-4">
                <p>• Elect to be paid the current base rate of pay of $<i><%= amount %></i>. This
                stipend is inclusive of all benefits and it is understood that your
                payments will be subject to the standard deductions required by law.
                Overloads will be paid in one lump sum at the end of the contract;</p>
                
                <p class="text-center"><strong>OR</strong></p>
                
                <p>• Elect to bank the 3 overload credits for teaching relief at a future
                date. Prior approval must be arranged with the Faculty Chair and
                Academic Dean. The maximum number of banked credits may not exceed 9
                credits at any time.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Payment Details -->
            <p class="mt-3">
                It is understood that your payment will be subject to the standard
                deductions required by law. For details concerning your payment,
                please contact <a href="mailto:payroll@algomau.ca">payroll@algomau.ca</a>.
            </p>

            <!-- Acceptance Section -->
            <div class="mt-4">
                <p>
                    If you are prepared to accept this offer under the conditions
                    stipulated, check which option you would like to receive then sign and
                    return to Faculty Relations within ten days of the date of this
                    letter.
                </p>

                <!-- Signature Block -->
                <div class="mt-4">
                    <p>Yours sincerely,</p>
                    <h4>Simon Xu, PhD</h4>
                    <p>Dean, Faculty of Computer Science and Technology</p>
                </div>

                <!-- CC List -->
                <div class="mt-4">
                    <p>
                        cc: HR<br>
                        Payroll<br>
                        OPSEU Local 685 President
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Acceptance Block -->
                <div class="mt-4">
                    <p>I hereby accept this offer</p>
                    <div class="signature-line"></div>
                    <p>Date: _________________________</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer Images -->
        <div class="algoma-footer">
            <img src="<%= asset_path('algoma-footer.png') %>" class="footer-image mt-1" alt="Algoma Footer">
        </div>
    </div>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>